```js
const fallbackGreeting = (lang) => {
  const map = {
    en: "Hello",
    es: "¡Hola",
    fr: "Bonjour",
    de: "Hallo",
    ja: "こんにちは",
    zh: "你好",
    // add more as you like …
  };
  return map[lang?.slice(0, 2)] || "Hello";
};
```

You can combine it with the language‑detected version (`getGreeting`) if the IP lookup fails:

```js
